# Overview 
# Dashboard Visualization Breakthrough!

Started transforming raw production data into actionable insights. The visualizations tell the story of oil & gas operations!

'Overview' Dashboard Features Built:

✅ Real-time production KPI scorecards.

✅ Interactive time series for oil/gas/water production over the years.

✅ Top 10 Operators are shown using Funnel. 

✅ Water-to-Oil Ratio (WOR) analysis reveals well performance issues. 

✅ Production decline analysis

✅ Operator performance benchmarking



Visualization Highlights:

📈 Production trends showing seasonal patterns

📈 While most wells maintain healthy ratios under 2.0, several wells like Steuben_JASPER_WYCKOFF (602.00) and Steuben_Unknown_Unknown (16.06) show concerning water breakthrough requiring immediate attention."

Geographic clustering of high-performing wells.

📈 Pennzoil Products Co. is the top producer, with a 21.82% difference from Quaker State Corp. 


